@startuml Mobile Native OIDC Authentication Flow
autonumber
skinparam actorStyle AWESOME

skinparam BoxPadding 10
skinparam ParticipantPadding 10

actor "Patient User" as User
box "Mobile Client Layer" #F4F9FF
    participant "Flutter App Context" as App
    participant "Secure Keystore" as Storage
end box

box "Edge Gateway Boundary" #FFFDF0
    participant "Nginx Gateway" as Nginx
end box

box "Identity & Backend Core" #FAFAFA
    participant "Keycloak IdP" as KC
    participant "Node.js BFF" as BFF
end box

== 1. Native AppAuth OIDC Flow ==
User -> App : Open Application while unauthenticated
App -> App : Instruction System Entropy Generation\n(Derive Cryptographic code_verifier + code_challenge)
App -> KC : Browser Launch (Challenge + OIDC Metadata)

alt AppAuth Session Missing / Invalid
    User <-> KC : Present Credentials + Resolve Multi-Factor Challenge
    KC -> KC : Verify Identity & Generate Auth Code
end

KC --> App : Emit Redirect Deep Link containing Secure Authorization Code
App -> KC : Backchannel Exchange (POST /token + Code + Verifier)
KC -> KC : Validate Code Verification Proof
KC --> App : Return Signed Token Payload
App -> Storage : Write Tokens to Hardware Isolation Layer

' == 2. Post-Auth Context Verification ==
' App -> Storage : Read Access Token
' ' App -> Nginx : GET /auth/me (Authorization: Bearer <Access_Token>)
' Nginx -> BFF : Forward Request with Bearer Token
' BFF -> BFF : Parse & Validate JWT \n (iss, aud, RS256)
' BFF --> Nginx : Return Resource JSON
' Nginx --> App : Forward 200 OK Context Response
' App -> User : Keep user signed in
@enduml